---
// src/pages/about.astro
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import LandingScreen from "@components/UI/LandingScreen.astro";
import Icono from "@svgs/paperclip.svg";

// import type { ImageMetadata } from "astro";

// Page metadata
const overtitle_line1 = "Expertise you can trust.";

const title_start = "Junglestar Agency ";
const title_end = " About us";
const title = title_start + " | " + title_end;

const onScroll_line1 = "So you wanna know about us huh? ";
const onScroll_line2 = "Like who we really, really are, maybe?!";
const onScroll_line3 = "Or even get to know us personally.";
const onScroll_line4 = "Or meet in person... via videochat?!";
const onScroll_line5 =
  "Well, find some answers here. For everything else, write us.";
const description =
  "SHOWCASE: We helped these small enterprises with websites, apps, and marketing communication.";
---

<style>
  .vpad {
    padding-block: calc(var(--space_block) * 3);
  }
</style>

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  bodyClass="about bg_green_light"
  mainClass="about bg_white"
  background="--jgreen_light"
>
  <Fragment slot="inside_header">
    <LandingScreen
      title={title_start}
      overtitle_line1={overtitle_line1}
      onScroll_line1={onScroll_line1}
      onScroll_line2={onScroll_line2}
      onScroll_line3={onScroll_line3}
      onScroll_line4={onScroll_line4}
      onScroll_line5={onScroll_line5}
    >
      <Icono width={133} height={133} fill="currentColor" />
    </LandingScreen>
  </Fragment>

  <div class="wrap vpad">
      <p class="h3"><strong>At Junglestar we help small biz.</strong></p>
      <p class="h4">We find and develop solutions, make websites and apps, grow relationships with clients.</p>
      <p>We've been dealing with communication for over 25 years.</p>
    <h2 class="center">FAQ</h2>

    <details class="who">
      <summary class="center">
        <strong>Who are we?</strong><small> TLDR: A bunch of geeks.</small>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        <br />
        Yes, geeks. Starting with the founder, 'Old Boy'
        <a title="Junglestar founder" href="https://tldr.rokma.com"
          ><strong>Rokma</strong></a
        > — and plenty of collabs over the years. Facts define labels.
      </p>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We're a group of professional coders with complementary skills. Not all
        of us are particularly geeky, though.
      </p>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        People work together and pay bills over the net, in 2026. If they wanna
        think we're in pajamas playing around — let 'em! 'Who the cap fits, let
        them wear it.'
      </p>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        When a project calls for it, we bring in consultants or freelancers on
        a one-shot basis. It depends on what's needed.
      </p>
      <br />
    </details>

    <details class="works">
      <summary class="center">
        <strong>Where can I see your work's history?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        Looking at old work risks normalizing past mistakes and outdated
        styles — or worse, drawing inspiration from expired interfaces.
      </p>

      <p class="wrap pretty">
        That's why we only show current projects, not a complete history.
        See them here: <a href="/showcase">
          <strong>Showcase</strong>
        </a>
      </p>
    </details>

    <details class="works">
      <summary class="center">
        <strong>Where are your LIVE Projects?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        Glad you open me, here: <br /><a href="/showcase">
          <strong>Showcase</strong>
        </a>
        .
      </p>
    </details>

    <details open class="">
      <summary class="center">
        <strong>Where we stand?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We stand for <strong>Actions & Productions.</strong> We think real-world speak
        louder than lingo & memes concoctions. No algo-speak ✌🏼 just juicy craftcakes.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Can you automate my social media posting?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        Yes. We build systems that schedule and publish your content
        automatically. You plan once, posts go out on time — no daily
        babysitting. You focus on your business, we handle the rhythm.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>I have no content strategy. Where do I start?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        With us. We help you find the right message, the right tone, and the
        right channels. We figure out what makes you different and turn that
        into content that actually connects with your audience.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Do you manage social media accounts?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We do. Content calendar, scheduling, publishing — we keep your channels
        active and consistent so your audience doesn't forget you exist. You
        delegate, we deliver.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong
          >Can I just get guidance without hiring you for the full job?</strong
        >
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        Of course. We offer consulting and guidance sessions. We'll show you
        shortcuts, help you avoid expensive mistakes, and point you in the right
        direction. Planning is cheaper than undoing.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Do you build custom websites or use templates?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        Custom. Tailored to how your business actually works — by human beings,
        not a platform or chatbot. We use modern open-source tools and
        frameworks, built around your workflow, not a generic template.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Will I be able to update the site myself?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We can show you how — but let's be frank, when you're already busy
        running your business, one more thing to manage won't help. That's why
        we offer fully-managed subscriptions: we handle all updates for you.
        When you need a change, just reach out — email or a scheduled call, real
        person, no ticket queue.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Why open source instead of Wix, Squarespace, etc.?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        No vendor lock-in, no surprise price hikes, no monthly subscriptions
        holding your site hostage. Open source means you own your tools. Your
        site survives even if a supplier changes its policies or prices.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Is my website going to work well on phones?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We build mobile-first. Over 60% of web traffic is on phones. Our sites
        load fast, look clean, and work on a 6-inch screen without pinch-zooming
        or treasure hunts.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Do I really need a website if I already have Instagram?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        Social platforms are rented land. The algorithm decides who sees you.
        Your competitors' ads sit next to your content. A website is yours —
        your message, your brand, your rules, no distractions.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Do you handle everything from design to launch?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        Design, code, testing, hosting, security, launch. One team, one plan, no
        vendor ping-pong. You have one conversation, one contract, one delivery.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Is this a subscription or a one-time cost?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        One-time cost. You pay once, you own it. Hosting and domain renewal is a
        small yearly fee (€55/yr), but the site itself is yours forever. No
        monthly platform fees.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>How long does a project take?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        It depends on scope. A packaged website can be ready in a week. Custom
        projects take longer. We define the timeline together upfront — no
        surprises.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>
          What if I already have a website but it's slow or outdated?</strong
        >
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We can rebuild it. Maybe it's faster than fixing it. Speed, modern
        design, mobile-friendly, proper SEO — we bring it up to current
        standards. Or we assess what's worth keeping and build from there.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Do you do branding and visual identity?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We help you develop your brand voice and visual consistency across all
        channels. One message, one look, everywhere. Your audience recognizes
        you instantly.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>What industries do you work with?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        Small businesses, freelancers, restaurants, local shops, creative
        professionals. If you're a small enterprise that needs to communicate
        clearly online, we're a good fit.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Can you help with SEO?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        SEO is built into how we build sites — fast loading, clean markup,
        proper structure, mobile-first. We don't sell SEO tricks. We build sites
        that search engines & LLMs naturally favor.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>What languages do you work in?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We work in English, the internet language! Sometimes our customers also
        need Italian, Spanish, French, German, Indonesian, Malay. We understand
        that culture matters — what works in one market doesn't always work in
        another. We adapt the message, not just translate it.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Do I need to know anything technical?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        No. We handle the technical side. You tell us what your business needs,
        we figure out how to build it. When it's ready, we teach you how to use
        it in plain language.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>What happens after launch? Do you disappear?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We don't. We assist you personally via email and, if needed, chat &
        video appointments. Need a change? Contact us. We're here for our
        customers — real people, not an automated support queue.
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>
        <strong>Why Junglestar instead of a big agency?</strong>
      </summary>
      <p class="wrap pretty">
        We're small on purpose. You talk to the people who actually build your
        project. No account managers, no middlemen. Flexible, fast, and 30 years
        of real-world experience making things that work.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</Layout>
